WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:21,610
Sir, I asked people to chase you with guns and don’t touch anyone.

2
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:25,330
The minister has been dragged away. What are you waiting for?

3
00:00:25,730 --> 00:00:33,710
Look clearly there are no bear paws or pig trotters

4
00:00:34,230 --> 00:00:39,940
Not even wings or legs

5
00:00:42,720 --> 00:00:44,360
At least the minister was dragged away.

6
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,220
walk without legs
